#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:146
msgid "%s is requesting to pair with this player."
msgstr "%s richiede l'associazione con questo lettore."

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:71
#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:147
msgid "A server is requesting to pair with this player."
msgstr "Un server richiede l'associazione con questo lettore."

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:298
msgid "ALSA device to capture from, such as a line-in or a microphone, and stream to the server. Only a paired server can use it, as a Live Input in Music Assistant. A card missing at startup costs only the input: the player plays without it and restarts with it once the card appears. Empty captures nothing."
msgstr "Dispositivo ALSA da cui acquisire, come un ingresso di linea o un microfono, e trasmettere al server. Può usarlo solo un server associato, come Live Input in Music Assistant. Una scheda assente all'avvio fa perdere solo l'ingresso: il lettore suona senza e si riavvia con l'ingresso appena la scheda compare. Vuoto non acquisisce nulla."

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:292
msgid "ALSA device to play through. A <code>hw:</code> device plays without resampling."
msgstr "Dispositivo ALSA su cui riprodurre. Un dispositivo <code>hw:</code> riproduce senza ricampionamento."

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:283
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni avanzate"

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:234
msgid "All"
msgstr "Tutta la lista"

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:349
msgid "Allow unpaired servers"
msgstr "Consenti server non associati"

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:105
msgid "Alternative to the pairing code, for servers that accept a pairing token. Treat it as a password."
msgstr "Alternativa al codice di associazione, per i server che accettano un token di associazione. Trattarlo come una password."

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:339
msgid "Announce over mDNS"
msgstr "Annuncia tramite mDNS"

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:66
#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:163
msgid "Approve"
msgstr "Approva"

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:325
msgid "Audio kept buffered by the device, in milliseconds."
msgstr "Audio mantenuto nel buffer del dispositivo, in millisecondi."

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:324
msgid "Buffer"
msgstr "Buffer"

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/sendspin.js:48
msgid "Card %d"
msgstr "Scheda %d"

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/sendspin.js:158
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Chiudi"

#: applications/luci-app-sendspin/htdocs/luci-static/resources/sendspin.js:109
